{"ts": "2026-09-17T14:27:20", "label": "noodlebar_sp010", "graph": "workflows/h3_text_to_video_api.json", "graph_sha256": "214f3dec2af32351", "patches": [{"nodes": ["21"], "field": "MiniMaxH3SolAttn.start_percent", "value": 0.1}, {"nodes": ["6"], "field": "RandomNoise.noise_seed", "value": 730451892}, {"nodes": ["13"], "field": "VHS_VideoCombine.filename_prefix", "value": "Video/sol_start_percent/noodlebar_sp010_s730451892"}, {"nodes": ["5"], "field": "MiniMaxH3Conditioning.prompt", "value": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium shot frames a late-night beef-noodle counter from the street side, a steel stockpot steaming under a bare bulb and a row of red plastic stools along the tiled front. Above the serving hatch a neon sign reading \"\u8001\u5f20\u725b\u8089\u9762\" glows in red tube script, mounted flush to the tiled lintel and centred over the hatch. A small radio on the shelf behind the counter plays a Cantonese pop song, a bright synth-backed ballad at a steady mid-tempo, thin and tinny through its single speaker. The camera zooms out with small amplitude at slow speed, opening the frame from the sign to the whole counter. A customer in a grey raincoat, on-screen, thirties, with a low, even tenor and a quick delivery (S1), steps up to the hatch, holds up two fingers toward the cook, and says: <d>[Chinese] \u4e24\u7897\u725b\u8089\u9762\uff0c\u4e00\u7897\u4e0d\u8981\u8fa3\u3002</d> He closes his mouth and lowers his hand to the counter edge. The cook in a white apron behind the stockpot nods once, lifts a ladle, and produces no vocal sound.\n\noverall_soundscape: A stockpot simmers steadily under the hum of a neon transformer. A ladle knocks against steel, a coat sleeve brushes the counter edge, and traffic passes wet and distant on the street behind.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n"}], "seed": null, "prompt_id": "feefed68-7253-4569-9ad1-585799588002", "rendered": {"prompt_id": "t2va_noodle_bar", "prompt_sha256": "667954291